cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, the model or the dataset, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Tricolour Lovestory (三色绘恋) character voice TTS: multi-speaker Qwen3-TTS fine-tuning with emotion control"
authors:
  - alias: starrydark
repository-code: "https://github.com/starryark/tricolour-tts"
url: "https://huggingface.co/starrydark/Tricolour_Lovestory_Qwen3_TTS"
license: Apache-2.0
version: "1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-30"
abstract: >-
  Reference-free Mandarin text-to-speech for 14 characters of the Tricolour Lovestory
  (三色绘恋) visual novels, made by fine-tuning Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-CustomVoice on the
  games' voice lines, with emotion instructions. Includes the data pipeline, a fixed
  multi-speaker trainer and a pre-registered evaluation.
keywords:
  - text-to-speech
  - Qwen3-TTS
  - fine-tuning
  - character voice
  - Mandarin
  - emotion control
  - Tricolour Lovestory
  - 三色绘恋
references:
  - type: article
    title: "Qwen3-TTS Technical Report"
    authors:
      - name: "Qwen Team"
    journal: "arXiv preprint arXiv:2601.15621"
    year: 2026
